{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Plague Purger procs on spell damage to undead (#12286)",
  "contract": [
    "#12286: Plague Purger (proc dummies 202136, 312726, 316726, 320726) never procced. Every dummy carries",
    "Spell.dbc ProcFlags 0 and the world had no spell_proc row, so SpellMgr::LoadSpellProcs skipped it. Tooltip:",
    "\"Dealing spell damage to undead\". Flags 69632 (harmful magic and none damage class spells) as the merged D1",
    "Magister 3-piece row for \"Casting damaging spells\". The undead limit is the burn's own TargetCreatureType 32",
    "(202135/312727/316727/320727). No cooldown in any tooltip. spell_proc_chance reads each loaded entry's",
    "chance, which equals the record's ProcChance, and spell_proc_cooldown_ms reads each loaded cooldown.",
    "aura_proc_rate replays the aura's native proc decision, including the roll, 40000 times on one synthetic",
    "event per check. It procs on a landed direct magic spell (Frostbolt 116), at the record's chance; it never",
    "procs on a landed melee ability (Heroic Strike 78), a periodic Shadow tick (Shadow Word: Pain 589). Before",
    "the repair the chance and cooldown lookups fail with 'Spell has no proc entry' and every rate reads 0, so",
    "the discriminating checks fail instead of flaking."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "caster",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 1,
      "level": 80,
      "allow_regeneration": false
    }
  ],
  "creatures": [
    {
      "id": "dummy",
      "owner": "caster",
      "entry": 36,
      "level": 80,
      "health": 1000000,
      "distance": 4
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
